## Third-Party Licenses

### Stockfish Chess Engine (GPL-3.0)

This project bundles and uses the Stockfish chess engine via WebAssembly:
- **Engine Files**: `public/stockfish.js`, `public/stockfish.wasm`
- **Stockfish Version**: 17.1 (Stockfish.js port by Chess.com, LLC / nmrugg)
- **Engine Source (JS/WASM build)**: https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js
- **Upstream Engine Project**: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish
- **Official Website**: https://stockfishchess.org/
- **License**: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
- **Full License Text**: Included in this repository at [LICENSE-GPL.txt](LICENSE-GPL.txt)

**GPL Compliance & Architecture Notice**:
Stockfish runs as an isolated background Web Worker (`public/stockfish.js`) communicating exclusively through the standard Universal Chess Interface (UCI) protocol over asynchronous string messages (`postMessage`). In accordance with Free Software Foundation (FSF) guidelines regarding aggregate works and process isolation:
- The GPL-3.0 license applies to the Stockfish engine files and any modifications thereto.
- The MIT License applies to this project's original UI, audio, and application wrapper code.
- Detailed attribution and source code instructions are available in [docs/STOCKFISH_ATTRIBUTION.md](docs/STOCKFISH_ATTRIBUTION.md).

### Other Open-Source Dependencies
All other third-party dependencies (React, chess.js, Vite, Tailwind CSS, etc.) are used under their respective permissive open-source licenses. Refer to `package.json` for details.

